autodoc-render-test

The 3D scene, its CPU rasterizer, its Vulkan renderer (scene/vulkan_linux.c, .h) and its shaders
(scene/shaders) are adapted from golib's gui/examples/scene3d
(https://github.com/yongjohnlee80/golib), Apache License 2.0, by the same author.

Changed from the original: the Vulkan read-back target renders into an OPTIMAL image in device
memory and is copied into a cached host buffer (vkCmdCopyImageToBuffer), where the original
rendered straight into a LINEAR image in host-coherent memory, which loses the device on NVIDIA.
